{"timestamp": 1759743737.2460575, "command": "git commit -m \"Enable context management tools in default agent profiles\n\nThe context management tools (list_history, memory, call_context_tool) were\nsuccessfully implemented and registered, but weren't available to the LLM agent\nbecause they weren't enabled in the agent profile settings.\n\nRoot cause: Zed's agent system requires tools to be explicitly enabled in\nprofile settings (assets/settings/default.json) even after registration in\nthe ToolRegistry.\n\nChanges:\n- Added list_history, memory, and call_context_tool to 'write' profile\n- Added list_history, memory, and call_context_tool to 'ask' profile\n- Created CONTEXT_TOOLS_INTEGRATION.md documenting the two-tier tool system\n- Documented the tool registration and enablement flow\n\nThis completes the integration of context management tools into Zed.\"", "sudo": false, "timeout": false, "exit_code": 0, "duration_sec": 0.0433, "truncated_stdout": false, "truncated_stderr": false, "bytes_stdout": 169, "bytes_stderr": 0, "shell": "/usr/bin/fish", "cwd": "/home/torstein.sornes/code/zed", "allowed_env_keys": ["DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS", "DISPLAY", "HOME", "LANG", "PATH", "SHELL", "SSH_AUTH_SOCK", "SUDO_ASKPASS", "TERM", "WAYLAND_DISPLAY", "XAUTHORITY", "XDG_RUNTIME_DIR"], "env_origins": {"PATH": "inherited_base", "HOME": "inherited_base", "LANG": "inherited_base", "SHELL": "inherited_base", "TERM": "inherited_base", "DISPLAY": "inherited_gui", "WAYLAND_DISPLAY": "inherited_gui", "XDG_RUNTIME_DIR": "inherited_gui", "DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS": "inherited_gui", "XAUTHORITY": "inherited_gui", "SSH_AUTH_SOCK": "inherited_gui", "SUDO_ASKPASS": "auto_default_askpass"}, "timeout_requested": 60000, "timeout_effective": 60000, "timeout_max": 600000, "timeout_clamp_reason": null}
